{"title":"Sentences to ponder","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/927065714/0/marginalrevolution~Sentences-to-ponder.html","date":1762015081000,"content":"<blockquote><p>We find that interventions (e.g., busing) that move children to a more favorable neighborhood have large effects but lose impact when they are scaled up because parents’ equilibrium responses push against successful integration with the new peer group.</p></blockquote>\r\n<p>That is from <span><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.nber.org/people/francesco_agostinelli\">Francesco Agostinelli</a>, </span><span><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.nber.org/people/matthias_doepke\">Matthias Doepke</a>, </span><span><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.nber.org/people/giuseppe_sorrenti\">Giuseppe Sorrenti</a> </span><span>&amp; <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.nber.org/people/fabrizio_zilibotti\">Fabrizio Zilibotti</a></span>.  Here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.nber.org/papers/w27050\" target=\"_blank\">the NBER version</a>, here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.journals.uchicago.edu/doi/abs/10.1086/739334\" target=\"_blank\">the JPE version</a>.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/11/sentences-to-ponder-134.html\">Sentences to ponder</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/927065714/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/927065714/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\"